[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0010","text":"──透前辈，把手伸出来～\n给你涂指甲～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0020","text":"好\n……你没什么精神嘛"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0030","text":"嗯～，在想组合live结束了呢～\n明明那么开心的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0040","text":"是、是很开心呢……！\n透同学和圆香同学觉得怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0050","text":"嗯─\n樋口呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0060","text":"挺好的吧\n观众席看起来也很开心"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0070","text":"浅仓呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0080","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0090","text":"……怎么说呢\n人好多啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0100","text":"诶……？\n你是说，粉丝们吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0110","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0120","text":"透前辈的粉丝\n可多了呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0130","text":"诶─\n好可怕"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0140","text":"他们看到了什么呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0150","text":"大、大家都\n在看舞台上的我们哦……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0160","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0170","text":"呵呵\n感觉像是我们在看他们那边"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0180","text":"……\n你在看别人的同时，也在被别人看吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0190","text":"是吗\n挺好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06020000_99_0200","text":"原来你看到了啊\n那个"}]
